# The app as an app (mbui's src/host/win_life.h), on the files the sign-in left: started again with a link of its
# schemes, it hands the link to the one that runs (this run) and ends; its window closed, this one goes on, put away;
# started again, it comes back. What the runner does (e2e/win.sh life_do) it says done in MBUI_DONE_DIR.
timeout 60000
answered {"topic":"accounts"}
log do: handed
done handed
log do: away
done away
shown
exit
